{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>El Moshe and el Aharon.</b> To appease Moshe's mind, HaShem took his brother Aharon with him. Another interpretation: <b>And He commanded them el the children of Israel</b> — to speak to them everything written above, from the beginning of the parashah until 'לכם מורשה אני ה׳'. And after that, they shall go <b>el Pharaoh</b> and speak to him on His behalf, to bring the children of Israel out of the land of Egypt."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:56:22.280903695Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}